{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turnbound is a strategic autobattler focused on experimentation, theorycrafting, and mastery of the odds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trying to outsmart your way to freedom from a haunted board game where each session pits you against the trapped souls of other players. You battle against the builds left behind by other real players in asynchronous PvP battles. It\u2019s a game of competitive inventory management, where every tile you place in your grid has a strategic cause-and-effect loop that impacts the tiles around it. It is a game that rewards foresight, creativity and luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your design outlive your ghostly opponents\u2026 or join them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/d9f497d2c0719a00d1a399cc7cfee920.avif?t=1774557784\" alt=\"Arrange and synergize\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/d9f497d2c0719a00d1a399cc7cfee920.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/3f493287febfe90d9a66515eea8dd913.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/3f493287febfe90d9a66515eea8dd913.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/3f493287febfe90d9a66515eea8dd913.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Shop Phase you pick, place or upgrade weapons, items, armour, consumables and accessories in the most optimal way. Trinkets let you unlock combos and winning battles let you upgrade your Hero through a branching set of abilities. Each round will have you making strategic decisions to execute synergies that give you an edge against your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/46eb0f4321fd77ac8741e9f0b0c6027d.avif?t=1774557784\" alt=\"Play at your own pace\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/46eb0f4321fd77ac8741e9f0b0c6027d.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/2abf4a2e1be99e40b10c15f909629544.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/2abf4a2e1be99e40b10c15f909629544.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/2abf4a2e1be99e40b10c15f909629544.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take all the time you want to plan your build and manage your board. Whenever you start a battle you will go against a build from the same chamber, with the same number of shop rounds as you. Whenever you exit a battle, your build is added to the matchmaking database and someone else can face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you win the whole run or not has no influence on which builds are added to the matchmaking database. The builds you face as opponents may have lost the run or still be in the middle of it. You can face the build of someone who has played seconds before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/78cf7422512c8bb35e404d0b2132183b.avif?t=1774557784\" alt=\"Become unbeatable\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/78cf7422512c8bb35e404d0b2132183b.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/459d2272b73189a3cea62970726824f4.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/459d2272b73189a3cea62970726824f4.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/459d2272b73189a3cea62970726824f4.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail counts and analyzing them is the key to understanding how to make the most of the tiles you have been given. The board won't always give you what you want, you will need to adapt your strategies, try new things and rely on a little bit of luck. Combat plays out from left to right, top to down - as each asynchronous multiplayer autobattle completes, use the helpful playback tools to better understand how your choices played out so you can improve your grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you keep playing your tiles right, you might just keep your soul intact - and make it to the top of the highest competitive chambers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9b40d298dbf826496708c77a577f644d.avif?t=1774557784\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/9b40d298dbf826496708c77a577f644d.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9362d9d1c2ca51b87f18050f9ce5e4bf.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9362d9d1c2ca51b87f18050f9ce5e4bf.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9362d9d1c2ca51b87f18050f9ce5e4bf.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have a winning build on your hands, you can compete directly instead of battling spirits asynchronously. Duels let you challenge a specific build by entering a simple code. Share your own builds with a unique code, test yourself against a friend\u2019s strategy or go up against selected Feature Builds from our community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fast, chaotic, strategic and the perfect way to prove once and for all whose tile brain actually reigns supreme.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of trinkets and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Chambers of progress and Final Chamber Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board, profile, rug and tile customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code &amp; build sharing\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Still not sure?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of our players have described it as \u201cBackpack Battles crossed with Hearthstone Battlegrounds,\u201d and said that it's like \u201cif The Bazaar met Backpack Battles\u201d or \u201cif Inventory Tetris and Hearthstone Battlegrounds had a cursed baby\u201d. So if any of those games interest you, you may have fun with this one too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO GEN AI </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Generative AI, was used to create any of the in-game art or assets. Not\u00a0even the battles are AI, all of them come from saved/winning builds created by other players. Even the tutorial where you play against \u201cthe cat&quot;, or occasional &quot;bot builds&quot; were crafted by our game designers.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ultimate Tile Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/2eca37e174210fd8aa7a109dbeb830fb9caf3197.jpg"},{"name":"Comeback","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/11c344e2b898ad6aafcf206e30ead3751d850a72.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Regenerator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/5fe686f9773a16b4547c6dddc42302e9b2e2a3ae.jpg"},{"name":"Alice Wins I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/c251180f1369471316197fce412752ccde44f344.jpg"},{"name":"Alice Wins II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/976a8a9eccb9a0f2facc8f64b9fcdf74ecde1856.jpg"},{"name":"Wukong Wins I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/aa0b08f4b447e8a3d393b23db2973eae2e11334b.jpg"},{"name":"Wukong Wins II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/e38044a712d23e6c1346e953402f95fd4a73d529.jpg"},{"name":"Robin Wins I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/b4ba65f23d68a56923b6ce56788121f7aaf6ad5a.jpg"},{"name":"Robin Wins II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/2eca37e174210fd8aa7a109dbeb830fb9caf3197.jpg"},{"name":"Live and learn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802470/98fde47455b53ee4b4d423d00029d15752f516e8.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802470?t=1774557784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/173813674c457764ee04c77af12f2bc3d71ea737/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774557784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/2d67f76e524221479e3440ef31bb1e3799a37869/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774557784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/2d67f76e524221479e3440ef31bb1e3799a37869/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774557784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3810040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/f29af18b7400567f547e910ac747933a.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turnbound is a strategic autobattler focused on experimentation, theorycrafting, and mastery of the odds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trying to outsmart your way to freedom from a haunted board game where each session pits you against the trapped souls of other players. You battle against the builds left behind by other real players in asynchronous PvP battles. It\u2019s a game of competitive inventory management, where every tile you place in your grid has a strategic cause-and-effect loop that impacts the tiles around it. It is a game that rewards foresight, creativity and luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your design outlive your ghostly opponents\u2026 or join them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/d9f497d2c0719a00d1a399cc7cfee920.avif?t=1774557784\" alt=\"Arrange and synergize\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/d9f497d2c0719a00d1a399cc7cfee920.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/3f493287febfe90d9a66515eea8dd913.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/3f493287febfe90d9a66515eea8dd913.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/3f493287febfe90d9a66515eea8dd913.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Shop Phase you pick, place or upgrade weapons, items, armour, consumables and accessories in the most optimal way. Trinkets let you unlock combos and winning battles let you upgrade your Hero through a branching set of abilities. Each round will have you making strategic decisions to execute synergies that give you an edge against your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/46eb0f4321fd77ac8741e9f0b0c6027d.avif?t=1774557784\" alt=\"Play at your own pace\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/46eb0f4321fd77ac8741e9f0b0c6027d.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/2abf4a2e1be99e40b10c15f909629544.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/2abf4a2e1be99e40b10c15f909629544.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/2abf4a2e1be99e40b10c15f909629544.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take all the time you want to plan your build and manage your board. Whenever you start a battle you will go against a build from the same chamber, with the same number of shop rounds as you. Whenever you exit a battle, your build is added to the matchmaking database and someone else can face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you win the whole run or not has no influence on which builds are added to the matchmaking database. The builds you face as opponents may have lost the run or still be in the middle of it. You can face the build of someone who has played seconds before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/78cf7422512c8bb35e404d0b2132183b.avif?t=1774557784\" alt=\"Become unbeatable\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/78cf7422512c8bb35e404d0b2132183b.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/459d2272b73189a3cea62970726824f4.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/459d2272b73189a3cea62970726824f4.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/459d2272b73189a3cea62970726824f4.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail counts and analyzing them is the key to understanding how to make the most of the tiles you have been given. The board won't always give you what you want, you will need to adapt your strategies, try new things and rely on a little bit of luck. Combat plays out from left to right, top to down - as each asynchronous multiplayer autobattle completes, use the helpful playback tools to better understand how your choices played out so you can improve your grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you keep playing your tiles right, you might just keep your soul intact - and make it to the top of the highest competitive chambers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9b40d298dbf826496708c77a577f644d.avif?t=1774557784\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras_big/9b40d298dbf826496708c77a577f644d.webp?t=1774557784 width=1560 height=340 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9362d9d1c2ca51b87f18050f9ce5e4bf.poster.avif?t=1774557784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9362d9d1c2ca51b87f18050f9ce5e4bf.webm?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/extras/9362d9d1c2ca51b87f18050f9ce5e4bf.mp4?t=1774557784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have a winning build on your hands, you can compete directly instead of battling spirits asynchronously. Duels let you challenge a specific build by entering a simple code. Share your own builds with a unique code, test yourself against a friend\u2019s strategy or go up against selected Feature Builds from our community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fast, chaotic, strategic and the perfect way to prove once and for all whose tile brain actually reigns supreme.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of trinkets and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Chambers of progress and Final Chamber Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board, profile, rug and tile customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code &amp; build sharing\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Still not sure?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of our players have described it as \u201cBackpack Battles crossed with Hearthstone Battlegrounds,\u201d and said that it's like \u201cif The Bazaar met Backpack Battles\u201d or \u201cif Inventory Tetris and Hearthstone Battlegrounds had a cursed baby\u201d. So if any of those games interest you, you may have fun with this one too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO GEN AI </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Generative AI, was used to create any of the in-game art or assets. Not\u00a0even the battles are AI, all of them come from saved/winning builds created by other players. Even the tutorial where you play against \u201cthe cat&quot;, or occasional &quot;bot builds&quot; were crafted by our game designers.</p>","developers":["1TK"],"dlc":[4314960],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802470/b7b13df91652f84b4e27bf5e7238f990149ec2fc/header.jpg?t=1774557784","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Fedora 25, Ubuntu 16.04, SteamOS, Mint 18<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 64bit with SSE2 instructions<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Vulkan 1.0 compatible (Nvidia Geforce 600 series, AMD Radeon HD7000 series)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet connection required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  OS X 10.11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core 64bit with SSE2 instructions<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Vulkan 1.0 compatible (Nvidia Geforce 600 series, AMD Radeon HD7000 series)<br></li><li><strong>Netwo